## Third-party material

| Item | Status |
|---|---|
| Code | none. Every line in this repository is written for it. There are no vendored libraries, no submodules and no copied files |
| Fonts | none bundled. Generated apps and the pages here use the system font stack |
| Icons | `icon.svg` is drawn for this project |
| Images | `assets/*.png` are screenshots rendered from this repository's own files |
| Data | no datasets are bundled |
| Model output | none is bundled. `tests/fixtures/reply-sloppy.md` is a hand-written fixture, deliberately malformed, used to test the repair path |

## Relationship to other drsamonline projects

KILN shares a design language with the rest of the estate — `forge`, the `*-kit` family,
`app-builder` — and borrows their lessons, which are credited in
[`AUDIT-FORGE.md`](AUDIT-FORGE.md). It does **not** import, vendor or depend on any of them.
The five "kits" named in `catalog/kits.json` are regions of
`templates/app/index.html`, in this repository.

If you later wire `app-builder` into a generated app's packaging workflow, that repository's
licence applies to that step, not this one.

